WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,180 --> 00:00:01,980
Lost in previous life

2
00:00:01,980 --> 00:00:03,380
He stands in front of me

3
00:00:03,780 --> 00:00:04,780
Didn't come out

4
00:00:05,790 --> 00:00:06,790
this life

5
00:00:07,390 --> 00:00:08,390
The roads have changed

6
00:00:08,590 --> 00:00:11,590
Will you come to me again?

7
00:00:14,520 --> 00:00:20,620
I asked you to hide in the convenience store, but you ran home instead to your stepfather and stepmother.

8
00:00:21,320 --> 00:00:22,720
And a baby brother

9
00:00:22,720 --> 00:00:24,920
That home is the most important place

10
00:00:24,920 --> 00:00:26,520
Convenience store with food and drinks

11
00:00:26,720 --> 00:00:27,920
Blocking the door and hiding in the warehouse

12
00:00:27,920 --> 00:00:29,720
The first batch of rescuers can be evacuated

13
00:00:29,720 --> 00:00:30,720
Go back to that home

14
00:00:30,720 --> 00:00:33,780
I'm escaping into the pit of fire. Just listen to me.

15
00:00:33,780 --> 00:00:34,980
Don't stay there

16
00:00:35,180 --> 00:00:36,780
Hurry back to the convenience store and block the door

17
00:00:36,780 --> 00:00:37,780
Hiding in the employee warehouse

18
00:00:40,970 --> 00:00:42,170
Bring a conductor to support you

19
00:00:42,170 --> 00:00:44,830
It's like carrying a ghost to watch him to death.

20
00:00:44,830 --> 00:00:45,830
Don't let him help with the funeral
